# Line endings, declared rather than inherited from whoever cloned last.
#
# The submission is evaluated from a ZIP unpacked on Windows as often as from a
# clone on Linux. Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true
# rewrites every text file to CRLF and the next diff shows the whole repository
# as changed. Nothing in the suite compares raw bytes, so this is hygiene rather
# than a fix - but it is the kind of hygiene that costs nothing here and is
# annoying to discover late.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The launchers are run by their own interpreter or by Git Bash; the executable
# bit is the part that matters for them.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touched, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
